/b0eb149fd466d9c33d5ac2b6240a3fa0c1818408/header.jpg?t=1792864901" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4274990/minibus-simulator">Minibus Simulator</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">Early Access · 22 Sep, 2026 · 151 reviews</div><div class="small">AI-assisted tools were used for texture creation and editing, while the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5090060/starlathe" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5090060/f2390ac9864a76e25957a8b190bf9e0206d3dd76/header.jpg?t=1792804443" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5090060/starlathe">Starlathe</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">Early Access · 1 Oct, 2026 · 150 reviews</div><div class="small">Some sprites, icons and sound effects were made with generative AI, then curated and hand-edited by the developer.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4071650/stream-train" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/512c370a44998c759933c3f22be977cd26f336b5/header.jpg?t=1793801123" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4071650/stream-train">Stream Train</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">16 Oct, 2026 · 149 reviews</div><div class="small">AI helped brainstorm extra chat message ideas, which the developers then edited and added to the game.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5025010/farm-to-fortune" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/e4e5eaf786cc6e043d42f4220d736a7b4abfbfac/header.jpg?t=1793648053" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5025010/farm-to-fortune">Farm to Fortune</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">30 Oct, 2026 · 143 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer discloses that AI tools were used, but does not specify which parts of the game are AI-generated.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4727860/war-footing" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727860/81dbb6590498e8559315dec705e04491d3412668/header.jpg?t=1792065570" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4727860/war-footing">War Footing</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">15 Oct, 2026 · 138 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used only for coding assistance; the developer says artwork was made by a paid human artist.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5164660/slime-trader" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5164660/d162d37ef0010deb37d42225904c1a2836791410/header.jpg?t=1790165845" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5164660/slime-trader">Slime Trader</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">19 Sep, 2026 · 137 reviews</div><div class="small">Uses AI for UI and development, with few details given.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3179120/monastery-ora-et-labora" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/cdc60046c2fcc2426b21947549b2375a108c4582/header.jpg?t=1790951736" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3179120/monastery-ora-et-labora">Monastery: Ora et Labora</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">Early Access · 24 Sep, 2026 · 137 reviews</div><div class="small">Some in-game art began as AI-generated concepts, then edited and arranged by hand by the developer&#39;s artist.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4454430/planet-killer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454430/1c461ef7aa009b39ef6bbe92e5de45cc807583c9/header.jpg?t=1791166664" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4454430/planet-killer">Planet Killer</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">9 Sep, 2026 · 136 reviews</div><div class="small">Some icons and ship concept art were made with AI-assisted tools and refined by the developer; gameplay and simulations are original.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3889540/i-need-to-fix-my-dream-car-but-i-work-at-a-junkyard" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889540/0a52875f84b61cf838afbc736eaa4b860f06a874/header.jpg?t=1789226019" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3889540/i-need-to-fix-my-dream-car-but-i-work-at-a-junkyard">I Need to Fix My Dream Car (But I Work at a Junkyard)</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">10 Sep, 2026 · 136 reviews</div><div class="small">Some minor 2D art was sketched with AI and refined, and some music samples were AI-created then composed by a person.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5063140/cards-everywhere" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5063140/b0a965c68f3fd352b5c1ec1a2697530c4aea64af/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1791865556" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5063140/cards-everywhere">Cards Everywhere!</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">17 Sep, 2026 · 134 reviews</div><div class="small">AI tools helped create collectible card artwork and some UI elements, all made before release and curated by the developer.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4897880/game" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897880/bb496183c9de5f5f04d234dac569e1c1f4817b4d/header.jpg?t=1793550819" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4897880/game">三国群英传之英雄传奇</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">17 Sep, 2026 · 134 reviews</div><div class="small">AI was used only for some promotional materials; the game itself shows no disclosed AI-generated content.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4493090/immortal-dao-idle" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493090/1c44cc61ad4619dd3ca655e1333f8888404a009f/header.jpg?t=1793666444" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4493090/immortal-dao-idle">Immortal Dao Idle</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Major AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">21 Sep, 2026 · 133 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer says AI generated the game&#39;s artwork and backend code, with the rest made by a solo hobbyist.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4338180/dearbnb" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/6e803c75fadd3dfed032291e1b3ab3c6e88afb52/header.jpg?t=1793260712" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4338180/dearbnb">Dearbnb</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">Early Access · 21 Oct, 2026 · 131 reviews</div><div class="small">Generative AI was used for some UI elements and icons; the rest of the game appears human-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4947900/augmented-yut" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947900/2d8363900ed4272b3b754df76f953b30c3942ff8/header.jpg?t=1792488637" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4947900/augmented-yut">Augmented Yut</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">18 Sep, 2026 · 126 reviews</div><div class="small">Generative AI assisted with in-game text, translations, 2D graphics, store images, and code; no live AI generation during play.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5013160/hubble-bubble" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013160/0b9d8ae5607debc9304edf94f4a6dd5c8afefdba/header.jpg?t=1793332416" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5013160/hubble-bubble">Hubble Bubble</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">23 Oct, 2026 · 124 reviews</div><div class="small">AI helped with store text, translations, achievement icons, and some music; aliens, environments, and animations are hand-made.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3098050/backseat" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098050/c1f1c924f49c9528daec5035bb2b90ac3fa76d9f/header.jpg?t=1793095822" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3098050/backseat">Backseat</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">9 Sep, 2026 · 123 reviews</div><div class="small">Some visual and audio elements, design references, and translations were made with AI tools, with final content reviewed by the team.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/1498550/infinity-hexadome-tactics" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/567acf57b4c789840f4f3a68eecd0ee6155dc9a3/header.jpg?t=1791200759" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/1498550/infinity-hexadome-tactics">Infinity: HexaDome Tactics</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">10 Sep, 2026 · 121 reviews</div><div class="small">AI text-to-speech provides the optional announcer voice, and AI assisted rendering of visual novel art later retouched by artists.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/4938070/2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938070/411380de58ba3c211a2110fec2c78fd9778442af/header.jpg?t=1793607620" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/4938070/2">我的钓鱼世界2</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Minor AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">14 Sep, 2026 · 120 reviews</div><div class="small">AI tools helped generate concept art and store-page assets during prototyping; final in-game art was manually refined by artists.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/3839910/only-fans" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839910/875a5b6d6e1672a2da09f23288661ff613f37c35/header.jpg?t=1792465274" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/3839910/only-fans">Only Fans</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · solid production</span><div class="small muted">19 Oct, 2026 · 120 reviews</div><div class="small">The developer disclosed that AI was used to generate some in-game environment textures; the rest appears human-made.</div></div></li></ul><details class="legend"><summary>What the labels mean</summary><dl><dt>Minor / Partial / Major AI, AI-driven</dt><dd>How much of the game is AI-generated, from the developer&#39;s disclosure.</dd><dt>solid production · mixed signals · mass-produced signs</dt><dd>Whether the game looks carefully made, from the developer&#39;s release pace, player reviews and the disclosure. An AI judgment, not a verdict.</dd><dt>No AI disclosure</dt><dd>The developer hasn&#39;t declared AI use on Steam. That isn&#39;t proof the game uses none.</dd><dt>Flagged, not disclosed</dt><dd>Steam curators say the game uses AI its store page doesn&#39;t disclose.</dd></dl><p style="margin:8px 0 0"><a href="/sources">How we check →</a></p></details></div></main><footer class="site"><div class="wrap"><nav><a href="/">Search</a><a href="/lists">Lists</a><a href="/anti-cheat">Anti-cheat &amp; accounts</a><a href="/stats">Stats</a><a href="/sources">Sources &amp; method</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact / disputes</a></nav><p>Data from public Steam store pages, Steam curators and open-source tools. Not affiliated with Valve or Steam.</p></div></footer><script>
(() => {
  const input = document.querySelector('[data-search]');
  if (!input) return;
  const box = document.createElement('div'); box.className = 'suggest'; box.hidden = true;
  box.id = 'suggest'; box.setAttribute('role', 'listbox');
  const live = document.createElement('div'); live.className = 'sr'; live.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  input.parentElement.append(box, live);
  input.setAttribute('role', 'combobox'); input.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'suggest');
  input.setAttribute('aria-autocomplete', 'list'); input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  const show = (on) => { box.hidden = !on; input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(on)); if (!on) input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant'); };
  let t, idx = -1;
  const label = (g) => g.has_ai ? '<span class="badge ai">AI disclosed</span>' : g.undisclosed ? '<span class="badge flag">Flagged</span>' : '<span class="badge clear">No AI disclosure</span>';
  const esc = (s) => s.replace(/[&<>"]/g, (c) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));
  input.addEventListener('input', () => {
    clearTimeout(t);
    const q = input.value.trim();
    if (q.length < 2) { show(false); return; }
    t = setTimeout(async () => {
      const r = await fetch('/api/search?q=' + encodeURIComponent(q));
      const games = await r.json();
      idx = -1;
      box.innerHTML = games.map((g, i) => '<a role="option" id="sg' + i + '" href="' + g.url + '"><span>' + esc(g.name) + '</span>' + label(g) + '</a>').join('');
      show(games.length > 0);
      live.textContent = games.length ? games.length + ' suggestions, use arrow keys' : 'No matching games';
    }, 150);
  });
  input.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { show(false); return; }
    const items = [...box.querySelectorAll('a')];
    if (!items.length || box.hidden) return;
    if (e.key === 'ArrowDown' || e.key === 'ArrowUp') {
      e.preventDefault();
      idx = (idx + (e.key === 'ArrowDown' ? 1 : -1) + items.length) % items.length;
      items.forEach((a, i) => { a.classList.toggle('on', i === idx); a.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(i === idx)); });
      input.setAttribute('aria-activedescendant', items[idx].id);
    } else if (e.key === 'Enter' && idx >= 0) { e.preventDefault(); location.href = items[idx].href; }
  });
  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (!input.parentElement.contains(e.target)) show(false); });
})();
</script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon="{&quot;token&quot;: &quot;a941fdedbf5e467c8766d72c46b1b799&quot;}"></script></body></html>